└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### DTO Mapping:

| Frontend Field | Backend DTO | Type |
|----------------|-------------|------|
| email | email | string (required) |
| password | password | string (required, min 8) |
| fullName | fullName | string (required) |
| phoneNumber | phoneNumber | string (required) |
| role | userType | enum (VETERINARIAN, CARE_STAFF, RECEPTIONIST, MANAGER) |
| salary | salary | number (required) |
| hireDate | hireDate | Date (required) |
| address | address | string (optional) |
| licenseNumber | licenseNumber | string (optional, for Vet) |
| expertise | expertise | string (optional, for Vet) |
| skills | skills | string[] (optional, for CareStaff) |

